  "historical_evidence": [
    {
      "id": "FAM:SF-TMP-009",
      "status_as_recorded": "artifact",
      "finding": "With lineup fixed effects, a PULL_UP exposure-effect slope was -0.0255; without them, -0.0063. A same-shooter placebo on other play types was -0.0071 to -0.0075, consistent with a shooter-level confound. The observed effect was an artifact."
