      "id": "FAM:SF-TMP-021",
      "what_failed": "Inferring penalty-state adaptation effects without clear distinction from placebo contrasts and without reporting standard errors.",
      "why": "E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records), with risks related to PLACEBO_DEPENDENCE and lack of statistical rigor."
    }
