        "code": "SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER",
        "text": "Many specific 5-player lineups will have limited minutes together across seasons, making it challenging to achieve statistical power for detecting meaningful changes in shot mix for individual lineups. This is especially true for 'changing' the lineup, which implies comparing the same lineup to a slightly different one."
