  "risks": [
    {
      "code": "CONFOUNDING",
      "text": "Lineup changes are endogenous decisions made by coaches in response to game situations (score, time, opponent, player performance), which are also major drivers of shot selection and shot mix. Without proper controls, any observed effect could be attributed to these confounders rather than the personnel change itself."
